" ▲ pSIONIUM test │ local · not signed in │ pq-hybrid-768 │ offline       portal "
"╭────────────────╮╭ Help ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮"
"│  1 Home        ││ Tutorial: encrypt and decrypt a file in about a minute     │"
"│  2 Encrypt     ││ Each step runs the real psion command in a temporary       │"
"│  3 Decrypt     ││ folder, deleted when the tutorial ends.                    │"
"│  4 Keys        ││                                                            │"
"│  5 Scan        ││  › 1. Create a practice identity                           │"
"│  6 Console     ││       An identity holds your keys: one to decrypt what     │"
"│  7 Settings    ││ others send you and one to sign what you send. This        │"
"│› 8 Help        ││ practice one has no passphrase; your real one should.      │"
"│                ││       Press Enter to run: psion keygen --no-passphrase -o  │"
"│ Send · Inbox   ││ practice.key                                               │"
"│ need accounts  ││  · 2. Write a sample file                                  │"
"│                ││  · 3. Encrypt it to yourself and sign it                   │"
"│                ││  · 4. Look inside without decrypting                       │"
"│                ││  · 5. Decrypt it and check the signature                   │"
"│                ││                                                            │"
